    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-FREE 5 APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 See next page Question 3 (8 marks) Solve the following equations, showing working where necessary. (a) 0.2𝑥= 5 (1 mark) (b) 𝑥3 = −64 (1 mark) (c) 7 − 𝑥−8 2 = −4 (2 marks) (d) 𝑥−1 3 = 𝑥+5 2 (2 marks) (e) 2 3 = 2𝑥+ 1 2 (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "CALCULATOR-FREE 5 APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 See next page SN245-093-2 Question 3 (8 marks) Solve the following equations, showing working where necessary. (a) 0.2𝑥= 5 (1 mark) (b) 𝑥3 = −64 (1 mark) (c) 7 − 𝑥−8 2 = −4 (2 marks) (d) 𝑥−1 3 = 𝑥+5 2 (2 marks) (e) 2 3 = 2𝑥+ 1 2 (2 marks) Solution 𝑥= 25 Specific behaviours ✓ Solves correctly Solution 𝑥= −4 Specific behaviours ✓ Solves correctly Solution 𝑥−8 2 = 11 𝑥= 30 Specific behaviours ✓ subtracts 7 from both sides and cancels negative ✓ multiplies by 2 and adds 8 Solution 2(𝑥−1) = 3(𝑥+ 5) 𝑥= −17 Specific behaviours ✓ cross multiplies ✓ expands and solves to get 𝑥= −17 Solution 1 6 = 2𝑥 1 12 = 𝑥 Specific behaviours ✓ subtracts 1 2 from 2 3 to get 1 6 ✓ divides 1 6 by 2 to get 1 12",
