    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-FREE 3 APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 See next page SN245-133-1 Section One: Calculator-free 35% (52 Marks) This section has eight (8) questions. Answer all questions. Write your answers in the spaces provided. Working time: 50 minutes. Question 1 (6 marks) Evaluate (a) 1 2 ℎ(𝑎+ 𝑏) when 𝑎= 2.8, 𝑏= 4.4, ℎ= 5 (2 marks) (b) 𝑥2 −4𝑥+ 1 when 𝑥= 1 2. (2 marks) (c) 𝑏2 + 𝑏𝑐+ √𝑐 when 𝑏= −5 and 𝑐= 9. (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "CALCULATOR-FREE 3 APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 See next page SN245-133-2 Section One: Calculator-free 35% (52 Marks) This section has eight (8) questions. Answer all questions. Write your answers in the spaces provided. Working time: 50 minutes. Question 1 (6 marks) Evaluate (a) 1 2 ℎ(𝑎+ 𝑏) when 𝑎= 2.8, 𝑏= 4.4, ℎ= 5 (2 marks) (b) 𝑥2 −4𝑥+ 1 when 𝑥= 1 2. (2 marks) (c) 𝑏2 + 𝑏𝑐+ √𝑐 when 𝑏= −5 and 𝑐= 9. (2 marks) Solution 2.5 × (7.2) = 18 Specific behaviours ✓ indicates correct substitution and calculates either 2.5 or 7.2 ✓ correct value Solution 𝑥2 −4𝑥+ 1 = (1 2) 2 −4 (1 2) + 1 = 1 4 −2 + 1 = −3 4 Specific behaviours ✓ substitutes correctly ✓ correct value Solution 𝑏2 + 𝑏𝑐+ √𝑐= (−5)2 + (−5)(9) + √9 = 25 −45 + 3 = −17 Specific behaviours ✓ evaluates at least two of the three terms correctly ✓ correct value",
