    "questionText": "APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 16 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page SN085-213-2 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Question 18 (9 marks) The weight in kg of crema, espresso and mocha coffee beans sold during a week by a business in their three stores in Ellenbrook, Forrestfield and Guildford is shown in matrix 𝑨, with the Forrestfield store selling 33 kg of crema beans and the Ellenbrook store selling 10 kg of mocha beans, which was 15.5 kg less than the weight of crema beans they sold. 𝑨= [ 25.5 13.5 10.0 33.0 22.5 8.5 39.5 19.5 12.5 ] (a) Determine the total weight of espresso beans sold by the business during the week. (1 mark) (b) Describe what information the element 𝑎3,1 represents in matrix 𝑨. (1 mark) (c) Determine matrix 𝑩, where 𝑩= 𝑨× [ 1 1 1 ], and describe what its elements represent. (2 marks) (d) Write down a suitable matrix 𝑪, so that the elements of 𝑪× 𝑨 represent the total weight of each type of coffee bean sold by the business during the week. (1 mark)",
    "answerText": "APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 16 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page SN085-213-4 Question 18 (9 marks) The weight in kg of crema, espresso and mocha coffee beans sold during a week by a business in their three stores in Ellenbrook, Forrestfield and Guildford is shown in matrix 𝑨, with the Forrestfield store selling 33 kg of crema beans and the Ellenbrook store selling 10 kg of mocha beans, which was 15.5 kg less than the weight of crema beans they sold. 𝑨= [ 25.5 13.5 10.0 33.0 22.5 8.5 39.5 19.5 12.5 ] (a) Determine the total weight of espresso beans sold by the business during the week. (1 mark) (b) Describe what information the element 𝑎3,1 represents in matrix 𝑨. (1 mark) (c) Determine matrix 𝑩, where 𝑩= 𝑨× [ 1 1 1 ], and describe what its elements represent. (2 marks) (d) Write down a suitable matrix 𝑪, so that the elements of 𝑪× 𝑨 represent the total weight of each type of coffee bean sold by the business during the week. (1 mark) Solution 𝑩= [ 25.5 13.5 10.0 33.0 22.5 8.5 39.5 19.5 12.5 ] × [ 1 1 1 ] = [ 49.0 64.0 71.5 ] The elements of 𝑩 represent the total weight of coffee beans sold in each of the stores. Specific behaviours ✓ correct matrix ✓ correct description Solution The weight o",
