    "questionText": "APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 4 CALCULATOR-FREE See next page Section One: Calculator-free 35% (52 Marks) This section has eight (8) questions. Answer all questions. Write your answers in the spaces provided. Working time: 50 minutes. Question 1 (6 marks) Evaluate (a) 1 2 ℎ(𝑎+ 𝑏) when 𝑎= 2.8, 𝑏= 4.4, ℎ= 5 (2 marks) (b) 𝑥2 −4𝑥+ 1 when 𝑥= 1 2. (2 marks) (c) 𝑏2 + 𝑏𝑐+ √𝑐 when 𝑏= −5 and 𝑐= 9. (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 4 CALCULATOR-FREE See next page (c) 𝑏2 + 𝑏𝑐+ √𝑐 when 𝑏= −5 and 𝑐= 9. (2 marks) Solution 𝑏2 + 𝑏𝑐+ √𝑐= (−5)2 + (−5)(9) + √9 = 25 −45 + 3 = −17 Specific behaviours ✔ evaluates at least two of the three terms correctly ✔ correct value",
