    "questionText": "APPLICATIONS UNIT 1 10 CALCULATOR-ASSUMED See next page Question 14 (9 marks) The weekly sales of Sumsang phones (the Ten, Plus and Note models) at retail outlets 𝐴, 𝐵 and 𝐶 is shown in matrix 𝑀. 𝐴 𝐵 𝐶 𝑀= [60 25 36 42 32 28 55 30 34 ] 𝑇𝑒𝑛 𝑃𝑙𝑢𝑠 𝑁𝑜𝑡𝑒 (a) In total, how many Note models were sold? (1 mark) (b) What does the element 𝑚21 in matrix 𝑀 represent? (1 mark) (c) Determine the matrix 𝑄, where 𝑄= [1 1 1 ] × 𝑀, and explain what 𝑄 shows. (2 marks) (d) Determine the matrix 𝑁, where 𝑁= 𝑀× [1 1 1 ], and explain what 𝑁 shows. (2 marks)",
