    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 9 APPLICATIONS UNITS 1 AND 2 See next page SN104-143-3 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Question 14 (8 marks) A person is considering a choice of two caterers to supply snacks for an office party. Caterer 𝐴𝐴 charges $20 per person plus a once-off booking fee of $150. (a) Calculate the cost of using caterer 𝐴𝐴 when (i) 10 people are expected to attend. (1 mark) (ii) 40 people are expected to attend. (1 mark) (b) Plot the two catering costs from (a) on the axes below and draw a straight line through them. (2 marks) Caterer 𝐵𝐵 simply charges $25 per person. (c) Add a line to the graph above to represent the cost of using caterer 𝐵𝐵. (2 marks) (d) Write a brief statement to the person recommending which caterer to use if minimising the cost was the only consideration. (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 9 APPLICATIONS UNITS 1 AND 2 See next page SN104-143-4 Question 14 (8 marks) A person is considering a choice of two caterers to supply snacks for an office party. Caterer 𝐴𝐴 charges $20 per person plus a once-off booking fee of $150. (a) Calculate the cost of using caterer 𝐴𝐴 when (i) 10 people are expected to attend. (1 mark) (ii) 40 people are expected to attend. (1 mark) (b) Plot the two catering costs from (a) on the axes below and draw a straight line through them. (2 marks) Caterer 𝐵𝐵 simply charges $25 per person. (c) Add a line to the graph above to represent the cost of using caterer 𝐵𝐵. (2 marks) (d) Write a brief statement to the person recommending which caterer to use if minimising the cost was the only consideration. (2 marks) Solution Both caterers cost the same for 30 people, but for less than 30 people use 𝐵𝐵 and for more than 30 use 𝐴𝐴. Specific behaviours  indicates cost same for 30 people  correct recommendations Solution 𝐶𝐶= 20 × 10 + 150 = $350 Specific behaviours  correct cost Solution (b) See graph Specific behaviours  plots both points  ruled straight line Solution 𝐶𝐶= 20 × 40 + 150 = $950 Specific behaviours  correct cost Solution",
