    "questionText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 13 APPLICATIONS UNITS 1 AND 2 See next page SN104-143-3 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Question 18 (9 marks) A shop usually sells the same brand of AAA batteries in packs of 4, 8 and 14 for $7.95, $13.90 and $19.92 respectively, but currently has the 4-packs and 8-packs on sale at 20% off. (a) Determine the total price and hence the average price per battery for 18 batteries when a customer buys a 4-pack and a 14-pack in the sale. (3 marks) (b) Use the sale prices to rank the pack sizes in order of value from best to worst. (3 marks) (c) The shop buys a carton containing 36 of the 14-packs from a wholesaler for $420.48 excluding GST. The shop then adds their profit margin of 𝑘𝑘% and another 10% GST to arrive at the advertised pack price above. Determine the value of 𝑘𝑘. (3 marks)",
    "answerText": "CALCULATOR-ASSUMED 13 APPLICATIONS UNITS 1 AND 2 See next page SN104-143-4 Question 18 (9 marks) A shop usually sells the same brand of AAA batteries in packs of 4, 8 and 14 for $7.95, $13.90 and $19.92 respectively, but currently has the 4-packs and 8-packs on sale at 20% off. (a) Determine the total price and hence the average price per battery for 18 batteries when a customer buys a 4-pack and a 14-pack in the sale. (3 marks) (b) Use the sale prices to rank the pack sizes in order of value from best to worst. (3 marks) (c) The shop buys a carton containing 36 of the 14-packs from a wholesaler for $420.48 excluding GST. The shop then adds their profit margin of 𝑘𝑘% and another 10% GST to arrive at the advertised pack price above. Determine the value of 𝑘𝑘. (3 marks) Solution Price of 4-pack = 7.95 × 0.8 = $6.36 Total batteries: = 4 + 14 = 18 Total price = 6.36 + 19.92 = 26.28 Price per battery = 26.28 ÷ 18 = $1.46 Specific behaviours  sale price for 4-pack  price and battery totals  average price per battery Solution 4-pack: 6.36 ÷ 4 = $1.59 ea 14-pack: 19.92 ÷ 14 = $1.42 ea 8-pack: 13.9 × 0.8 = 11.12 ⇒11.12 ÷ 8 = $1.39 ea Value ranking from best to worst: 8-pack, 14-pack, 4-p",
