    "questionText": "APPLICATIONS UNITS 1&2 10 CALCULATOR-FREE End of questions SN153-183-1 DO NOT WRITE IN THIS AREA AS IT WILL BE CUT OFF Question 8 (8 marks) A farmer grew two varieties of potato, Pontiac and Snow Gem. The time for each crop to mature is normally distributed with the times shown in the following table. Variety Pontiac Snow Gem Mean time for crop to mature (days) 95 104 Standard deviation of time for crop to mature (days) 5 4 (a) Use deviations from the mean (standard scores) to explain which of the following would be more unusual: a crop of Pontiac maturing in 101 days; or a crop of Snow Gem maturing in 101 days. (3 marks) (b) Use the 68%, 95%, 99.7% rule to determine the approximate probability that (i) a crop of Pontiac takes less than 95 days to mature. (1 mark) (ii) a crop of Snow Gem takes between 92 and 116 days to mature. (2 marks) (iii) a crop of Pontiac matures in more than 105 days. (2 marks)",
    "answerText": "APPLICATIONS UNITS 1&2 10 CALCULATOR-FREE End of questions SN153-183-3 Question 8 (8 marks) A farmer grew two varieties of potato, Pontiac and Snow Gem. The time for each crop to mature is normally distributed with the times shown in the following table. Variety Pontiac Snow Gem Mean time for crop to mature (days) 95 104 Standard deviation of time for crop to mature (days) 5 4 (a) Use deviations from the mean (standard scores) to explain which of the following would be more unusual: a crop of Pontiac maturing in 101 days; or a crop of Snow Gem maturing in 101 days. (3 marks) (b) Use the 68%, 95%, 99.7% rule to determine the approximate probability that (i) a crop of Pontiac takes less than 95 days to mature. (1 mark) (ii) a crop of Snow Gem takes between 92 and 116 days to mature. (2 marks) (iii) a crop of Pontiac matures in more than 105 days. (2 marks) Solution 𝑆𝑆= 105 −95 5 = 2 𝑃(within 2 sd of mean) = 95% 𝑃= 1 −0.95 2 = 0.025 Specific behaviours  indicates standard score for days  correct probability Solution 𝑃(less than mean) = 50% = 0.5 Specific behaviours  correct probability Solution 𝑆𝑆= 92 −104 4 = −3, 𝑆𝑆= 116 −104 4 = +3 𝑃(within 3 sd of mean) = 99.7% = 0.997 Specific ",
